p We’re looking for an engineer who is looking  to drive marketing and growth initiatives for Nitrous, the #1 development platform and PubStorm, our new front-end web publishing and hosting service.

p We’re looking to drive the next 300,000 developers to our platform, ensure they love what we’re building, and that they have the best onboarding experience possible.

h3 Responsibilities

ul
  li This role is 50% engineering and 50% marketing.
  li Envision, plan and implement new initiatives that will drive new users to discover our products.
  li Optimize onboarding workflows
  li Implement analytics on growth initiatives and report performance weekly

h3 Technologies & Experience

ul
  li Ruby, Python, NodeJS, ReactJS
  li Postgres, Redis
  li Websockets
  li Events analytics: Intercom, Mixpanel, Heap, GA or equivalent

h3 Requirements

ul
  li Risk taker, not afraid to break things to push the envelope of what’s possible
  li You love people and aren’t afraid to cold-call or send cold emails pitching product partnerships or integrations
  li Can handle (and sometimes prefer) handling projects independently
  li You’re a generalist that can write good copy, spin up and optimize ad campaigns quickly, write programming tutorials, and implement drip marketing